<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 572.58, up 4.08.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 368 to 195.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.09.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,348,080 compared with 18,786,100 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
